# Live click-to-link witness: two rendered Inti node endpoints are seeded by
# canonical commands before Julia arms link mode and clicks them.
author start inti-map-link-live
inti map create live-link-map "../../../exports/sprites/templates/User Level Up LLC Logo.png"
inti map node add link-left 0.25 0.30
inti map node add link-right 0.75 0.70
author placement link path inti map path add {a} {b}